Phan 8: Quan ly Mang nang cao, DNS & Reverse Proxy trong Linux -
Chu de 8
Trong phan 8 cua buoi hoc thu tam nay, chung ta nghien cuu chuyen sau ve cau hinh va quan tri may chu
phan giai ten mien BIND9 (DNS Server), thiet lap Nginx lam Reverse Proxy va Load Balancer (Round
Robin, Least Connections), cau hinh SSL/TLS termination va quan ly luu luong mang nang cao cho cac he
thong phan tan doanh nghiep.
1. Ly thuyet va Phuong phap Quan tri Chuyen sâu:
- DNS Server Administration (BIND9): Cau hinh zone files, ban ghi A, CNAME, MX, TXT va co che
caching/forwarding cho he thong mang noi bo.
- Nginx Reverse Proxy & Load Balancing: Cau hinh upstream blocks, phan phoi tai nguyen giua cac
microservices, xu ly SSL termination va security headers.
- Network Troubleshooting & Security: Su dung dig, nslookup, iptables/nftables va firewalld de kiem tra va
bao ve ha tang mang.
2. Mau Cau hinh Nginx Reverse Proxy & Load Balancer (Phan 8):
Nginx Reverse Proxy & Load Balancer Configuration - Module
Administrator: Le Hong Son | Date: October 2026
------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Upstream configuration for backend service load balancing
upstream enterprise_cluster {
least_conn;
server 10.0.1.10:8080 max_fails=3 fail_timeout=10s;
server 10.0.1.11:8080 max_fails=3 fail_timeout=10s;
}
# 2. Server block with SSL and Reverse Proxy rules
server {
listen 443 ssl;
server_name sonledev.cloud;
location / {
proxy_pass http://enterprise_cluster;
proxy_set_header Host $host;
proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
}
}
3. Bai tap thuc hanh & Thao luan nhom:
- Cau hinh may chu BIND9 DNS noi bo cho mien enterprise.local trong phan 8.
- Thiet lap Nginx Reverse Proxy kem SSL certificate va thu nghiem phan phoi tai nguyen load balancing
cho module 8.
